- Return 404 for a Lightning receive only when the wallet has none
  `GET /api/v1/lightning/receives/{identifier}` returned 404 for any error
  of the lookup. Other errors now return 500, so a client can tell a
  receive that does not exist from one that could not be read.
  [#21](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/21)
